    "original_requirement": "实现一个双按钮模式控制的 LED 系统，使用按钮 D2、按钮 D3、PWM LED D9 和 TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）。D2 切换三种模式：常灭、常亮、呼吸灯；D3 用于调整当前模式参数，如常亮亮度或呼吸速度；数码管显示当前模式编号或参数值。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个双按钮模式控制的 LED 系统，使用按钮 D2、按钮 D3、PWM LED D9 和 TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）。D2 切换三种模式：常灭、常亮、呼吸灯；D3 用于调整当前模式参数，如常亮亮度或呼吸速度；数码管显示当前模式编号或参数值。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v1\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"pwm_output\", \"pin\": \"D9\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D3\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": null}",
